text Scenein "mood dawn lively\nsay Seventeen percent of 240 is 40.8.\nnumber right warm: 40.8 | 17% of 240\nnote left: How | 240 x 0.17 = 40.8\n"
fn main to int
put Inlen 0 len Scenein
for i ulong len Scenein
put In i get Scenein i
end
check scene 1001
check eq get Sc 0 1 1002
check eq get Sc 1 2 1003
check eq get Sc 2 1 1004
check eq get Sc 3 2 1005
check eq get Sc 6 0 1006
check eq get Things 0 3 1007
check eq get Things 1 2 1008
check eq get Things 4 1 1009
check eq get Things 6 2 1010
check eq get Things 16 1 1011
check eq get Things 17 1 1012
put Inlen 0 0
check not scene 1013
check eq get Sc 3 0 1014
ret int get Fails 0
end
